OL,3,ATrump officials threaten Kennedy Center
OL,4,Ademolition if court blocks renovations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Trump administration has threatened
OL,7,Fto demolish the Kennedy Center if
OL,8,Fplanned renovations for the performing
OL,9,Farts venue are not allowed to be
OL,10,Fcarried out, court documents show.
OL,12,FAttorneys from the justice department
OL,13,Fhave also asked for President Donald
OL,14,FTrump's name to be put back on the
OL,15,Fbuilding after it was removed in June
OL,16,Ffollowing a court order.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
